        "message": "=<p>Thank you!</p>\n\n<p>Your request has been submitted successfully.</p>\n\n<p>If your email address is not already registered, you will receive a confirmation email shortly with your personal link to complete your candidate profile.</p>\n\n<p>If you have already registered, there is no need to submit another request. Please use the link you previously received by email.</p>\n\n<p>Please also check your spam or junk folder if you do not receive the email within a few minutes.</p>\n\n<p>We appreciate your interest in joining Luminar Consulting GmbH.</p>",
