        "message": "= <p>Hello {{ $json.Email }},</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for your interest in joining <strong>Luminar Consulting GmbH</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>We have successfully received your initial application.</p>\n\n<p>Please complete your candidate profile by clicking the link below:</p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"{{ $('Build Detail Form URL').item.json.detailFormUrl }}\">\nComplete Candidate Profile\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>If the button above does not work, you can also copy and paste the following link into your browser:</p>\n\n<p>{{ $('Build Detail Form URL').item.json.detailFormUrl }}</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for your time. We look forward to reviewing your application.</p>\n\n<p>\nKind regards,<br>\nLuminar Consulting GmbH\n</p>",
